# Secrets belong in Container Apps env vars / secrets, never in the image —
# they must never be readable inside a build context or a build-time layer.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# FACTS.md is NOT excluded: src/pages/facts.astro reads it at build time to
# render /facts from the same file that governs every cited number on the
# site. Excluding it here builds a container that dies with ENOENT while the
# local build stays green, so leave it in the context.
